 "panels": [
  {
   "type": "text",
   "title": "",
   "transparent": true,
   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "**A soak** runs a real JAM network for a long time under steady trading load, then checks that nothing was lost and the chain stayed healthy (`soak/run NET SECS`; `soak/README.md`). The load generator offers 12 crossing order pairs a minute, 20% of them sealed; the DEX batches them into rounds, each a work-package the validators guarantee, assure, audit and accumulate; after SECS of load, 180 s of drain let the last rounds settle; then every order's fate and the chain on every node are judged.\n\n**Read it top down.** Pick a net and a run: its verdict, phase and configuration first, then one tile per check, green when it passed, each showing what was measured and what it had to reach. A run passes only if every check passes. The links open the chain, lasair, DEX, memory and log dashboards for the same run. At the bottom, every soak so far, newest first: click a run id to open it here with its time range.\n\n| Check | Passes when |\n|---|---|\n| offered load | \u2264 0.01% of the offered orders turned away (refused or busy) |\n| clearing SLO | \u2265 0.9999 of the orders that could trade did |\n| SEALED zero-loss | no sealed order stuck between commit and reveal |\n| one head | every node agrees on the head, at every sample |\n| liveness | every node's best block advances |\n| finality | blocks finalized, no conflict, no stall of an epoch or more |\n| authoring | every validator authored blocks |\n| state parity | every node holds byte-identical DEX state at one finalized block |"
   },
   "id": 1,
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 0,
    "w": 24,
    "h": 13
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "row",
   "title": "The selected run",
   "collapsed": false,
   "panels": [],
   "id": 2,
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 13,
    "w": 24,
    "h": 1
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "stat",
   "title": "Verdict",
   "description": "PASS only if every check below passed. Empty while the soak runs.",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prometheus"
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "expr": "max(soak_pass{run_id=\"$run_id\"})",
     "refId": "A",
     "range": false,
     "instant": true
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "decimals": 0,
     "noValue": "running",
     "color": {
      "mode": "fixed",
      "fixedColor": "text"
     },
     "mappings": [
      {
       "type": "value",
       "options": {
        "0": {
         "text": "FAIL",
         "color": "red"
        },
        "1": {
         "text": "PASS",
         "color": "green"
        }
       }
      }
     ]
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {
    "graphMode": "none",
    "colorMode": "background",
    "textMode": "value",
    "justifyMode": "center",
    "reduceOptions": {
     "calcs": [
      "lastNotNull"
     ],
     "fields": "",
     "values": false
    }
   },
   "id": 3,
